rity Failures","security"],"precision":"very-high"}},{"id":"package_managers.pnpm.pnpm-block-exotic-sub-dependencies.pnpm-block-exotic-sub-dependencies","name":"package_managers.pnpm.pnpm-block-exotic-sub-dependencies.pnpm-block-exotic-sub-dependencies","shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: package_managers.pnpm.pnpm-block-exotic-sub-dependencies.pnpm-block-exotic-sub-dependencies"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Missing or incorrect blockExoticSubdeps. Set `blockExoticSubdeps: true` to transitive dependencies from being installed from untrusted sources. Added in: v10.26.0 Reference: https://pnpm.io/settings#blockexoticsubdeps"},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"helpUri":"https://semgrep.dev/r/package_managers.pnpm.pnpm-block-exotic-sub-dependencies.pnpm-block-exotic-sub-dependencies","help":{"text":"Missing or incorrect blockExoticSubdeps. Set `blockExoticSubdeps: true` to transitive dependencies from being installed from untrusted sources. Added in: v10.26.0 Reference: https://pnpm.io/settings#blockexoticsubdeps\n💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at sg.run/pro","markdown":"Missing or incorrect blockExoticSubdeps. Set `blockExoticSubdeps: true` to transitive dependencies from being installed from untrusted sources. Added in: v10.26.0 Reference: https://pnpm.io/settings#blockexoticsubdeps\n\n#### 💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at <a href='https://sg.run/pro'>sg.run/pro</a>\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [Semgrep Rule](https://semgrep.dev/r/package_managers.pnpm.pnpm-block-exotic-sub-dependencies.pnpm-block-exotic-sub-dependencies)\n - [https://pnpm.io/settings#blockexoticsubdeps](https://pnpm.io/settings#blockexoticsubdeps)\n"},"properties":{"tags":["CWE-829: Inclusion of Functionality from Untrusted Control Sphere","HIGH CONFIDENCE","OWASP-A08:2021 - Software and Data Integrity Failures","security"],"precision":"very-high"}},{"id":"package_managers.pnpm.pnpm-missing-minimum-release-age.pnpm-minimum-release-age","name":