age"},"fullDescription":{"text":"This Renovate configuration does not set a minimum release age. Newly published packages can be malicious or unstable. Add `\"minimumReleaseAge\": \"7 days\"` within a `packageRules` entry to wait 7 days before proposing updates to newly published package versions. Set `\"minimumReleaseAge\": false` to set an exception for minimal release age for the package rule. Added in: v42"},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"helpUri":"https://semgrep.dev/r/package_managers.renovate.renovate-missing-minimum-release-age.renovate-missing-minimum-release-age","help":{"text":"This Renovate configuration does not set a minimum release age. Newly published packages can be malicious or unstable. Add `\"minimumReleaseAge\": \"7 days\"` within a `packageRules` entry to wait 7 days before proposing updates to newly published package versions. Set `\"minimumReleaseAge\": false` to set an exception for minimal release age for the package rule. Added in: v42\n💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at sg.run/pro","markdown":"This Renovate configuration does not set a minimum release age. Newly published packages can be malicious or unstable. Add `\"minimumReleaseAge\": \"7 days\"` within a `packageRules` entry to wait 7 days before proposing updates to newly published package versions. Set `\"minimumReleaseAge\": false` to set an exception for minimal release age for the package rule. Added in: v42\n\n#### 💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at <a href='https://sg.run/pro'>sg.run/pro</a>\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [Semgrep Rule](https://semgrep.dev/r/package_managers.renovate.renovate-missing-minimum-release-age.renovate-missing-minimum-release-age)\n - [https://docs.renovatebot.com/configuration-options/#minimumreleaseage](https://docs.renovatebot.com/configuration-options/#minimumreleaseage)\n"},"properties":{"tags":["CWE-829: Inclusion of Functionality from Untrusted Control Sphere","HIGH CONFIDENCE","OWASP-A08:2021 - S