cription":{"text":"Document Builder being instantiated without calling the `setFeature` functions that are generally used for disabling entity processing. User controlled data in XML Document builder can result in XML Internal Entity Processing vulnerabilities like the disclosure of confidential data, denial of service, Server Side Request Forgery (SSRF), port scanning. Make sure to disable entity processing functionality."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"helpUri":"https://semgrep.dev/r/scala.lang.security.audit.documentbuilder-dtd-enabled.documentbuilder-dtd-enabled","help":{"text":"Document Builder being instantiated without calling the `setFeature` functions that are generally used for disabling entity processing. User controlled data in XML Document builder can result in XML Internal Entity Processing vulnerabilities like the disclosure of confidential data, denial of service, Server Side Request Forgery (SSRF), port scanning. Make sure to disable entity processing functionality.\n💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at sg.run/pro","markdown":"Document Builder being instantiated without calling the `setFeature` functions that are generally used for disabling entity processing. User controlled data in XML Document builder can result in XML Internal Entity Processing vulnerabilities like the disclosure of confidential data, denial of service, Server Side Request Forgery (SSRF), port scanning. Make sure to disable entity processing functionality.\n\n#### 💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at <a href='https://sg.run/pro'>sg.run/pro</a>\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [Semgrep Rule](https://semgrep.dev/r/scala.lang.security.audit.documentbuilder-dtd-enabled.documentbuilder-dtd-enabled)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/A05_2021-Security_Misconfiguration](https://owasp.org/Top10/A05_2021-Security_Misconfiguration)\n"},"properties":{"tags":["CWE-611: Improper Restriction of XML External Entity Reference","HIGH CONFIDENCE","OWASP-A02:20